      "content": "but it's not just a feeling. it's the reality of it. i see it in my moms face every time i have a bad day, just that pure exhaustion. it's like i'm stealing their happiness to feed my own problems. if i were actually thinking about being selfless, wouldn't i want to stop being the source of their pain? it feels like the only way to actually love them is to stop being a problem for them.",
